#. まずは、学級裁判の簡単な説明から始めましょう！
#. 学級裁判の結果はオマエラの投票により決定されます。
msgctxt "0001 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Let's begin with a basic explanation of the class\n"
"trial! So, your votes will determine the results."
msgstr ""

#. 正しいクロを指摘出来れば、クロだけがおしおき。
#. だけど…もし間違った人物をクロとした場合は…
msgctxt "0002 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"If you can figure out \"whodunnit\" then only they will\n"
"receive punishment. But if you pick the wrong one..."
msgstr ""

#. クロ以外の全員がおしおきされ、
#. みんなを欺いたクロだけが晴れて卒業となりまーす！
msgctxt "0003 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Then I'll punish everyone *besides* the blackened, and\n"
"the one that deceived everyone else will graduate!"
msgstr ""
"Thì ta sẽ trừng phạt tất cả mọi người *ngoại trừ* kẻ thủ ác, và\n"
"kẻ đã lừa dối tất cả mọi người sẽ được tốt nghiệp!"

#. さてと…何から始める？
msgctxt "0004 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Now then...where to begin...?"
msgstr ""

#. 犯人は…もう決まってるよ…！
msgctxt "0005 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "We already know who did it...!"
msgstr ""

#. あ！　なんか、デジャヴだ！！
msgctxt "0006 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Whoa! Deja vu!"
msgstr ""

#. さくらちゃんを殺した犯人は…
msgctxt "0007 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "The one who killed Sakura..."
msgstr ""

#. さくらちゃんの事を憎んでた十神か、腐川か、葉隠！
#. あんた達の誰かだよ！！
msgctxt "0008 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"...is one of the people that hated her! Byakuya, Toko,\n"
"or Hiro! It was one of you!"
msgstr ""

#. フン…バカバカしい…
msgctxt "0009 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Hmph. Idiot."
msgstr ""

#. あ、あたしは…関係ないわよ…
msgctxt "0010 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "I-I had nothing to d-do with it..."
msgstr ""

#. そ、そ、そ、そうだべ…！
#. お、お、俺が人殺しなんて…す、する訳ねーべ…！
msgctxt "0011 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Y-Yeah! I'd never kill someone, no way!"
msgstr ""

#. 言い訳したって…駄目だよ…！
msgctxt "0012 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I don't wanna hear your stupid excuses!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの３人の誰かが犯人…
#. 朝日奈さんはそう言い切ってるけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hina seems really sure that one of those three is the\n"
"killer...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこまで言い切るからには、
#. 何か根拠があるはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But she must have some reason for believing that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
